  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Metal Arms is a Family BASIC homebrew made by Shingo and a few others, though they aren't credited. This games is extremely smooth and extremely fast paced. There are 3 layers of background stars moving at different speeds which add a lot of depth. Lots of bosses which are smaller but look more ship-like and at least 3 standard enemy types. Bullets all over the screen. It's also very difficult."
    }
  ],
